  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tech Ass program (MEPR) financed by the Poverty and Environment Fund  (PEF). PEF is a facility to improve work within the ADB. MEPR has 4   main outputs:(i) increased environment mainstreaming in ADB projects; (ii) subprojects supporting poverty reduction and improvement in      living conditions; (iii) increased knowledge management in ADB (iv)   adequate management and administration of the fund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tekniskt st&#xf6;d (MEPR) som finansieras genom &quot;Fattigdoms- och           milj&#xf6;fonden&quot; (PEF). PEF &#xe4;r en facilitet f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra arbetet     inom ADB. MEPR har 4 m&#xe5;l: (i) &#xf6;kat milj&#xf6;t&#xe4;nk i ADB-projekt; (ii)      subprojekt som st&#xf6;djer fattigdomsminskning och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade            levnadsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden; (iii) f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad ledning genom (milj&#xf6;)kunskap    inom ADB (iv) adekvat ledning och administration av fonden.</narrative>
  </description>
